oad Cheats", "Downloading cheats", "Cheat List", "{0} on", "Not available during netplay", "Host Game", "Stop Hosting", "Leave Game", "Hosting • {0} connected", "Connected to {0}", "Waiting for players…", "Cheat {0}", "Get More Emulators", "Downloading emulator", "No other emulators for this system", "Emulator installed", "Cheat Collection", "Not downloaded", "Updated {0}", "About 37 MB from libretro, with cheats for thousands of games", "Update", "Play together with consoles on the same network running nuubOS or RetroArch.", "Search Again", "Searching for netplay games…", "No games found. On the other console, start a game and choose Host Game in its Quick Menu.", "Not in your library", "Needs the emulator {0}", "Hosted by {0}", "Join", "The game could not be joined", "The game restarts from this point as a host", "Looking for emulators…", "Starting netplay…", "Needs a password", "Add to Library", "Which system is {0}?", "Adding {0} to the library", "{0} files added to the library", "Already in the library", "No games found here", "Looking for PCs and NAS on the network…", "Choose a PC or NAS", "Type an Address", "Choose a Folder on {0}", "Type a Folder Name", "Closing game…", "January", "February", "March", "April", "May", "June", "July", "August", "September", "October", "November", "December", "{0} {1} {2}", "{3} {0} {1} {2}", "No battery", "Screen Layout", "Two Screens", "Large Top Screen", "Picture in Picture", "Single Screen", "Stylus", "Stylus on", "Stylus off", "Right Stick", "Left Stick", "D-Pad", "{0} moves it, L2 touches", "Emulation Accuracy", "Fast", "Accurate", "Choose Accurate if the game misbehaves", "Removes the game, its cover and details from the library for every user. Saves are kept.", "Show Unavailable Games", "Games whose file is missing or on an SD2 card that is not inserted", "Use an Existing Folder", "Join saves, states or screenshots your other devices already share", "Folder ID", "Folder ID {0}", "Shared by {0}", "Leave empty to use the 